      "description": "Flat Earth Sun & Moon Clock: A Conceptual Exploration of Time, Sky, and Seasons\nThe Flat Earth Sun & Moon Clock lets you track the sun and moon's positions across the AE (Azimuthal Equidistant) map. Observe the rhythm of day and night, and watch the sun’s 28-day cycle lap the moon. Explore seasonal changes as the sun moves between the Tropic of Capricorn and Cancer, and gain insights into celestial mechanics from an alternative perspective.\n\nKey Features: \n• Friend Finder: \n• Featured Video: Daily educational content on the sky clock, with an archive to revisit past videos. \n• Connect with like-minded users worldwide. Share your location or keep it private, with options   for messaging, group chats, voice, and video calls. (Outgoing calls and messages requires one time yearly app subscription)\n • Match Maker: Find a special like-minded someone within your selected radius. \n• Meetup Maker: Create or join local meetups and receive notifications for new events. \n• Messaging: Exchange 1-on-1 messages or join groups that include video chats (requires one time app yearly subscription). \n• Zodiac Star Wheel: Track sun and moon positions through astrological cycles. \n• Books: Explore flat earth-related books for all ages, from new works to classics. \n• Homeschool Links: Curated content for homeschooling families, including memberships to private social media groups. \n• Time-lapse: Watch sun and moon movements and see day-night cycle changes, especially during equinoxes. \n• Customizable Backgrounds: Choose from Antarctica, high-altitude balloon shots, or ocean vistas, or upload your own. \n• World Compass: Visualize how circumnavigation on a flat Earth model actually works. \n• Analog Clock: Track the sun and moon with an analog clock showing day and night cycles. \n• Local Weather: Get daily weather, temperature, and sunrise/sunset times (ad-free, detailed forecast requires one time app yearly subscription).\n • World Weather on AE Map: Real-time weather data, including wind patterns and magnetic flux lines, compared to the globe model. \n• Sunrise & Sunset & Moon Phase Percentage: Includes daylight savings, 12/24-hour clock, and language options. \n• Shopping: Browse flat earth-related products, books, and community-created items.\n\nAdditional Features: \n• Multi-language videos and content • Censorship-free video search (requires one time app yearly subscription) \n• Flat earth images and gifs (search images feature requires one time app yearly subscription) \n• World time in any location\n • Countdown timer for upcoming events \n• Referral feature to invite friends and earn $DOME crypto currency \n• Delete account and all records anytime via Friend Finder log out or settings.\n\nSubscription Information:\n A one time all inclusive yearly subscription of $10.99 USD unlocks ALL premium features, including profiles, messaging, calls, Match Maker, meetup creation, uncensored video/image search, detailed weather services, and future feature updates.\n\nCompatibility: \n• Requires iOS 14.0 or later \n• Compatible with iPhone 6 or later\nFor more details, review our Terms & Conditions and Privacy Policy.",
